        "1 cup fresh strawberries, hulled",
        "1 cup fresh orange juice",
        "0.25 cup brown sugar"
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "text": "Place the peaches, strawberries, orange juice, and brown sugar in a food processor. Puree until smooth."
        },
        {
